---
/*
 * Fixture header for `header-carrier.test.ts` (FR-024): the smallest component a
 * theme could put in the `dk:site-header` slot. `data-dk-test-header` is the
 * marker the test counts; nothing in the toolkit or in Starlight emits it.
 *
 * It carries no skip link and no menu button on purpose. In Starlight 0.32 both
 * are rendered outside the header (`Page.astro` renders `SkipLink` before the
 * page frame, `PageFrame.astro` renders `MobileMenuToggle` in the sidebar nav),
 * so they survive a header replacement; the test asserts that they do.
 */
---
<div data-dk-test-header="wp06"><a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>Fixture header</a></div>
